sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant Post

    Client->>Post: equals(otherPost)
    activate Post
    
    alt same instance
        Post->>Post: this == obj
        Note right of Post: equals method compares object references
        Post-->>Client: return true
        Note right of Client: true if same instance
    else obj is null
        Post->>Post: obj == null
        Note right of Post: If null comparison
        Post-->>Client: return false
        Note right of Client: false if null
    else different class types
        Post->>Post: getClass() != obj.getClass()
        Note right of Post: If class types differ
        Post-->>Client: return false
        Note right of Client: false if different class types
    else same class type
        Post->>Post: this.id == other.id
        Note right of Post: Compares ID field values
        Post-->>Client: return equality result
        Note right of Client: true if IDs match, false otherwise
    end
    
    deactivate Post